</section><div id="shopify-section-template--24127198298398__multirow" class="shopify-section section"><link href="//pickleand.club/cdn/shop/t/2/assets/multirow.css?v=116853658605657988131741333295" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />



<div class="multirow section-template--24127198298398__multirow-padding gradient color-scheme-1">
  <div class="page-width"><div class="multirow__inner row-multiple-block">
      
        <div class="multirow-left-block multirow-sticky-content">
          
            <div class="sp-small" ><div class="card__subheading rte" >
                  <p><strong>To kickstart</strong></p>
                </div>
                <h2 class="h2"><strong>Pickleball 101</strong></h2>
              
              
                <div class="rte">
                  <p>Pickle & features an advanced Live Score AI System that tracks and displays your game score in real-time.</p>
                </div>
              
              
                <div class="banner-image"><!-- style="padding-bottom: 69.2938209331652%;" --><img src="//pickleand.club/cdn/shop/files/Screenshot_2025-03-07_at_3.36.29_PM.png?v=1741332999&amp;width=535" alt="" srcset="//pickleand.club/cdn/shop/files/Screenshot_2025-03-07_at_3.36.29_PM.png?v=1741332999&amp;width=165 165w, //pickleand.club/cdn/shop/files/Screenshot_2025-03-07_at_3.36.29_PM.png?v=1741332999&amp;width=360 360w, //pickleand.club/cdn/shop/files/Screenshot_2025-03-07_at_3.36.29_PM.png?v=1741332999&amp;width=535 535w" width="535" height="371" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1600px) 750px,
                    (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)">
                </div>
              
              
                <div class="cta-button">
                <a 
                  
                    href="/pages/tutorial"
                  
                  class="button button--primary"
                  >
                    Interactive Tutorial
                  </a>
                </div>
              
            </div>
          
        </div>
      
      
        <div class="multirow-right-block"><div
            class="multirow-items isolate"
            
          >
            <div class="multirow-text__content text-center sp-small color-scheme-70ea5dfd-7e6b-4774-ad01-c1bc8bc4850e"><h3 class="multirow-text__heading h3 rte">
                  1.Basic Rules
                </h3><div class="multirow-t-text__text rte text-center"><p>A game is played to 11 points in either singles (1v1) or doubles (2v2). </p><p>Players must win by a 2-point margin; if tied at 10-10, play continues until one side leads by 2.</p><p>The match winner is the first to win 2 out of 3 games. Remember that only the serving side can score points.</p><h2></h2></div></div>
          </div><div
            class="multirow-items isolate"
            
          >
            <div class="multirow-text__content text-center sp-small color-scheme-f1bfe909-7038-4886-aa58-000aaea3f8cb"><h3 class="multirow-text__heading h3 rte">
                  2.Serve
                </h3><div class="multirow-t-text__text rte text-center"><p>The server must hit the ball underhand diagonally across the court. When serving, the ball must clear the non-volley zone of the opponent's court.</p></div></div>
          </div><div
            class="multirow-items isolate"
            
          >
            <div class="multirow-text__content text-center sp-small color-scheme-70ea5dfd-7e6b-4774-ad01-c1bc8bc4850e"><h3 class="multirow-text__heading h3 rte">
                  3.Two-Bounce Rule
                </h3><div class="multirow-t-text__text rte text-center"><p>The serving side must bounce the ball once before returning it to the opponent’s court. No volley (no-bounce return) is allowed until the ball is bounced twice in the court.</p></div></div>
          </div><div
            class="multirow-items isolate"
            
          >
            <div class="multirow-text__content text-center sp-small color-scheme-f1bfe909-7038-4886-aa58-000aaea3f8cb"><h3 class="multirow-text__heading h3 rte">
                  4.Kitchen Rule
                </h3><div class="multirow-t-text__text rte text-center"><p>Volleys are not permitted while standing in or touching the kitchen (non-volley zone). </p><p>Players cannot step into the kitchen due to momentum immediately after hitting a volley. </p><p>A player may only enter the kitchen to play a ball that has bounced within this zone.</p></div></div>
          </div><div
            class="multirow-items isolate"
            
          >
            <div class="multirow-text__content text-center sp-small color-scheme-70ea5dfd-7e6b-4774-ad01-c1bc8bc4850e"><h3 class="multirow-text__heading h3 rte">
                  5.End of a Rally
                </h3><div class="multirow-t-text__text rte text-center"><p>A rally ends under any of the following situations.</p><ol><li>The ball falls on the out. (behind the baseline or outside the sideline)</li><li>The ball hits the net and falls on one’s own side.</li><li>The ball bounces twice on one side and the player cannot return it.</li></ol></div></div>
          </div></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


